OL,3,AThree killed and dozens missing after  
OL,4,Afire at Indonesian factory             
OL,6,FAt least three people have been killed 
OL,7,Fafter a fire at a confectionery factory
OL,8,Fin western Java on Saturday, with the  
OL,9,Fdeath toll expected to rise.           
OL,11,FFirefighters were still tackling some  
OL,12,Fflames on Sunday, while rescuers       
OL,13,Fsearched for around 36 missing in parts
OL,14,Fof the damaged building where workers  
OL,15,Fwere believed to be trapped.           
OL,17,FIndonesia's National Search and Rescue 
OL,18,FAgency said on Sunday 15 survivors had 
OL,19,Fbeen located, and four others taken to 
OL,20,Fhospital and a local clinic with       
OL,21,Fundisclosed injuries.                  
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
