OL,3,AThree killed and dozens missing after  
OL,4,Afire at Indonesian factory             
OL,6,FRescuers recovered 24 body bags from   
OL,7,Fthe fire as of Sunday evening, as      
OL,8,Fsearch operations continue to locate   
OL,9,Fmissing people.                        
